{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Browsers the agent cannot protect (they ignore the Chrome, Edge and Firefox policies the agent writes, or bypass filtering by design). In a protected account they are closed within 3 seconds. A process matches by its exe name, by the ProductName in its version info, or by a part of its path (lower case, backslashes). Exe names shared with other programs (browser.exe, chrome.exe, firefox.exe) are matched only by product name or path. Vivaldi is listed because its Windows policy support is not documented by Vivaldi (checked 3 Nov 2026); move it back when a test shows vivaldi://policy applying ours.",
